{"title":"跑步学大庆　先进更先进","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1977,"month":8,"day":11}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"陈祖言　罗达成诗"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本报记者摄"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陈祖言,罗达成"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是凯旋呵是出征，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"无限激情心头涌；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大庆路上阔步走，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"红旗千秋擎手中。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"众姐妹，紧相围，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代表纵情谈体会；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大会盛况说不尽，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜讯随同笑声飞。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小组讨论情似火，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千言万语对党说，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奔向四个现代化，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大家齐唱大庆歌"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各路英雄多气派，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"向阳红花胸前开；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝会师来交流，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来日咱们再竞赛!"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜洋洋，迎代表，笑把锦旗上下瞧；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"荣誉面前不陶醉，响鼓更要重锤敲!"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜报频传浦江畔，决心凝成志气篇；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"莫道代表一万八，一千万人同心干!"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"砸烂万恶“四人帮”，群英济济聚一堂，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"扬眉吐气学大庆，掌声更比雷声响!"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""}],"comments":[],"origin":"本报","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}